WEBVTT

00:00:02.072 --> 00:00:05.872
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:10.144
Todoke Message

00:00:10.547 --> 00:00:19.478
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.257 --> 00:00:20.757
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.757 --> 00:00:28.799
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.799 --> 00:00:29.128
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:36.535
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.907 --> 00:00:41.037
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.144 --> 00:00:45.137
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.449 --> 00:00:49.545
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:53.121
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.457 --> 00:00:57.450
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.761 --> 00:01:01.595
Todoke Message

00:01:01.998 --> 00:01:10.098
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:14.476
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.878 --> 00:01:18.678
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.149 --> 00:01:28.581
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:37.626
On this day, envoys from the Royal
Court have come to visit Shurei Hong.

00:01:39.336 --> 00:01:43.830
They've come to inform her of the results
of her aptitude test, and let her know...

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:47.168
...whether or not she can take the last
test of the National Exams.

00:02:00.524 --> 00:02:04.187
Shurei Hong, Aptitude Test, pass.

00:02:08.331 --> 00:02:11.630
Shurei will now study for her first
and last attempt at the final exam...

00:02:12.302 --> 00:02:15.032
...a big step toward realizing
her childhood dream...

00:02:15.105 --> 00:02:16.800
...of becoming a court official.

00:02:19.109 --> 00:02:24.069
Discretion is the Better Part of Valor

00:02:44.768 --> 00:02:46.099
I'm here.

00:02:59.816 --> 00:03:01.443
The end of the road.

00:03:08.625 --> 00:03:11.219
There's a little over a month
until the final exam.

00:03:11.294 --> 00:03:13.592
There's been a sudden increase
in people arriving here.

00:03:13.663 --> 00:03:15.631
How are you keeping up
security in the town?

00:03:15.699 --> 00:03:18.532
As in past years, the gangs
will see to it that the streets are safe.

00:03:18.602 --> 00:03:21.230
There's a rumor going around
that needs to be looked into.

00:03:21.304 --> 00:03:24.762
I'll provide you with a report
once I've gathered more information.

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.978
Things are likely to get busy
from now on.

00:03:29.045 --> 00:03:31.445
I'm relying on you two.

00:03:31.681 --> 00:03:33.114
You can count on us.

00:03:43.493 --> 00:03:47.793
- You want to break for lunch?
- Sorry, I've got someplace to go.

00:03:48.365 --> 00:03:50.560
To the red-light district.

00:03:50.634 --> 00:03:51.999
The red-light district?!

00:03:52.068 --> 00:03:55.401
Don't look at me like that.
This is also part of my duties.

00:03:55.472 --> 00:03:56.962
Really.

00:04:20.463 --> 00:04:21.765
Kogaro

00:04:21.765 --> 00:04:22.732
Kogaro
Hey, Shurei.

00:04:23.733 --> 00:04:25.291
Hey. Come on.

00:04:25.368 --> 00:04:27.802
You're going somewhere again,
aren't you?

00:04:27.871 --> 00:04:30.499
I hear you've been making
farewell visits around town.

00:04:32.475 --> 00:04:34.966
You're at that ripe age now.

00:04:35.045 --> 00:04:37.980
Why not quit wandering around
and settle down already?

00:04:38.448 --> 00:04:40.575
You're getting a bit old
not to be married.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:43.380
It's gonna get a lot more difficult
to find a praiseworthy partner...

00:04:43.453 --> 00:04:45.387
...that'll take you without a dowry.

00:04:45.989 --> 00:04:50.551
W-Well, I'm from a rich family
so I wouldn't ask for any dowry.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:57.331
Regardless of how late I am in getting
married, or how unlikely I am to be...

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:00.631
...taken by someone, you're just a
childhood friend so it's not your concern!

00:05:00.704 --> 00:05:02.638
W-Well the point I'm making is...!

00:05:02.706 --> 00:05:05.732
In any case, I don't have the time
to deal with you today.

00:05:06.276 --> 00:05:08.574
Hurry up and go home, Santa.

00:05:08.645 --> 00:05:11.079
Don't call me Santa!
Call me Keicho!

00:05:11.147 --> 00:05:14.480
You don't seem to have grown up,
so Santa's more than appropriate.

00:05:16.353 --> 00:05:19.151
Oh, my.
Master Ou's young man.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:22.658
Oh, Miss Kocho!

00:05:23.627 --> 00:05:25.322
What is it this time,
young man?

00:05:25.395 --> 00:05:28.728
Are you here to hit on her again?
You never learn.

00:05:30.667 --> 00:05:34.433
Young man, if you can wait until
nighttime, I'll play with you.

00:05:35.205 --> 00:05:39.574
I'll set some special time aside,
just for you.

00:05:39.643 --> 00:05:41.304
N-No, that's fine.

00:05:41.378 --> 00:05:44.404
I'd never have enough money
for your services, Miss Kocho.

00:05:45.649 --> 00:05:46.911
S-See you later!

00:05:50.487 --> 00:05:52.751
Boy! Talk about gutless!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:55.890
You're up very early today.

00:05:56.559 --> 00:05:59.551
My client ended up leaving
in the middle of the night yesterday.

00:05:59.929 --> 00:06:01.920
Leaving the chambers
of the number one woman...

00:06:01.998 --> 00:06:03.966
...of the red-light district
in the middle of the night?!

00:06:04.034 --> 00:06:06.229
There are some
foolish men out there.

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.235
But thanks to him...

00:06:08.304 --> 00:06:11.432
...I can spend more of what little time
you have left here with you.

00:06:13.677 --> 00:06:17.636
You'll be working for us
for only seven more days, right?

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:22.017
Yes.

00:06:23.153 --> 00:06:27.317
I still remember that little girl
who came all on her own...

00:06:27.891 --> 00:06:30.917
...bowing her head low,
asking to work here.

00:06:31.895 --> 00:06:34.455
You'd obviously been
brought up very well...

00:06:34.531 --> 00:06:37.625
...let alone your bearing
the Hong name.

00:06:39.335 --> 00:06:41.326
You had such a grim look
on your face...

00:06:41.404 --> 00:06:45.636
...so I figured that you were more than
prepared to come to the red-light district.

00:06:46.176 --> 00:06:48.940
But, I have to prepare dinner
in the evening...

00:06:49.012 --> 00:06:51.310
...so I'll need to be home by sunset.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:03.523
I asked you to forget about that!

00:07:05.595 --> 00:07:08.530
Quite some time
has passed since then.

00:07:08.598 --> 00:07:11.066
The days go by so quickly,
don't they?

00:07:11.134 --> 00:07:14.228
Shurei, make certain that you come
on your last day of work.

00:07:14.304 --> 00:07:17.899
I have something to give you.

00:07:18.208 --> 00:07:20.039
Please, don't bother...!

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:22.977
Hey. Don't be so cold.

00:07:23.847 --> 00:07:27.146
You're the only one
who's ever been able...

00:07:27.217 --> 00:07:30.414
...or ever will be able to get me
to promise a date, Shurei.

00:07:31.554 --> 00:07:33.522
Got that? It's a promise.

00:07:34.257 --> 00:07:36.225
Otherwise, I'll tell Mr. Hong
and Seiran...

00:07:36.359 --> 00:07:38.953
...that you've been working
in the red-light district.

00:07:39.362 --> 00:07:43.924
P-Please, anything but that!
I'll come! You have my word!

00:07:46.302 --> 00:07:50.898
Oh, by the way, an unusual guest
arrived yesterday.

00:07:50.974 --> 00:07:52.942
An unusual guest?

00:08:16.332 --> 00:08:17.560
A child?

00:08:17.634 --> 00:08:20.262
I'm guessing he's around twelve
or thirteen years old.

00:08:20.737 --> 00:08:24.764
That... certainly does qualify
as an unusual guest.

00:08:24.841 --> 00:08:27.275
Wh-Wh-Wh-Where am I?!

00:08:28.878 --> 00:08:31.403
My, it seems like he's awake.

00:08:34.117 --> 00:08:37.245
You don't even remember
coming here? Um...?

00:08:37.687 --> 00:08:39.655
Oh, I'm Eigetsu To.

00:08:40.657 --> 00:08:41.749
Eigetsu.

00:08:42.492 --> 00:08:46.292
I just arrived in Kiyo yesterday and got
tangled up with some gangsters.

00:08:47.096 --> 00:08:50.588
I remember up to the point of being
dragged into a restaurant, but...

00:08:51.801 --> 00:08:54.065
Um, how did I get here?

00:08:54.504 --> 00:08:56.563
One of our regulars
carried you here...

00:08:56.639 --> 00:08:59.608
...and asked us to put you up
for a while.

00:08:59.676 --> 00:09:02.611
He paid us well for it,
so we agreed.

00:09:03.146 --> 00:09:07.276
What?! I can't possibly impose like that!
How much is it?

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:10.615
I'll pay you,
so please return the money to him.

00:09:11.554 --> 00:09:13.613
Huh? This seems rather light.

00:09:15.959 --> 00:09:18.951
What? This is a lot less than I had!

00:09:19.028 --> 00:09:20.620
You don't even have
enough here...

00:09:20.697 --> 00:09:22.688
...to last you a month
at the cheapest lodging!

00:09:22.765 --> 00:09:26.895
I'm sure I had more yesterday.
Wh-Wh-What should I do?!

00:09:27.237 --> 00:09:30.400
How about accepting their generosity
and stay here for the time being?

00:09:30.707 --> 00:09:32.174
B-But...!

00:09:32.775 --> 00:09:34.868
If you'd rather,
why not stay at our place?

00:09:35.812 --> 00:09:38.440
It's a bit rundown,
but we have lots of space.

00:09:38.882 --> 00:09:41.783
And last year, we had a bear-like person
stay without prior notice...

00:09:41.851 --> 00:09:43.785
...so we're used to
unexpected visitors.

00:09:45.588 --> 00:09:50.321
I'm truly sorry for imposing like this.
Is it really all right?

00:09:50.827 --> 00:09:52.727
Well, can you help me
with something then?

00:09:52.795 --> 00:09:53.693
Yes?

00:09:53.763 --> 00:09:56.857
Actually, I could use some help
finishing the accounting.

00:09:57.367 --> 00:10:00.131
Ah, sure! I'm pretty good
at that sort of thing.

00:10:00.637 --> 00:10:02.730
Then I'll leave it to you,
Eigetsu.

00:10:02.805 --> 00:10:03.772
Yes!

00:10:09.879 --> 00:10:11.870
You're quite something, Eigetsu.

00:10:11.948 --> 00:10:14.712
You're really fast and accurate
with calculations.

00:10:14.784 --> 00:10:16.217
You amazed me.

00:10:16.286 --> 00:10:18.254
You're too kind.

00:10:18.488 --> 00:10:19.682
My Lady.

00:10:22.225 --> 00:10:23.692
Seiran. What is it?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:25.694
I thought we'd go to a restaurant
for dinner tonight...

00:10:25.762 --> 00:10:27.696
...so I came to meet you.

00:10:27.764 --> 00:10:29.732
That's a bit extravagant.

00:10:29.866 --> 00:10:31.834
While it's a little late...

00:10:31.901 --> 00:10:35.132
...consider it a congratulatory dinner
for passing the aptitude test.

00:10:35.471 --> 00:10:36.938
Huh? For me?

00:10:41.077 --> 00:10:43.045
Thank you, Seiran.

00:10:52.789 --> 00:10:56.885
My, it must've been quite a journey
coming all the way from Koku Province.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.757
Well, yes.

00:10:58.828 --> 00:11:01.160
Not to mention,
he's only thirteen.

00:11:01.397 --> 00:11:03.456
But since the final exam
is taking place shortly...

00:11:03.533 --> 00:11:05.728
...many people are here
from elsewhere...

00:11:06.169 --> 00:11:09.900
...so it's kind of dangerous for those
not familiar with the city.

00:11:10.406 --> 00:11:12.465
Whatever the reason you're here,
I suggest...

00:11:12.542 --> 00:11:14.806
...you get it over with quickly
and go back home.

00:11:14.877 --> 00:11:16.572
I guess you're right.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:20.277
Come to think of it, have you heard
the rumors about this year's final exam?

00:11:21.184 --> 00:11:24.017
Apparently, there are a lot of kids.

00:11:24.087 --> 00:11:26.749
Rumor has it that there's
even a woman.

00:11:26.823 --> 00:11:28.518
Yeah, I heard!

00:11:28.591 --> 00:11:29.683
She's only sixteen
or seventeen...

00:11:29.759 --> 00:11:32.728
...and they say there's no doubt
she'll take top spot.

00:11:32.795 --> 00:11:36.754
So I put thirty percent of my fortune
on her taking the top spot.

00:11:37.166 --> 00:11:41.102
Didn't you bet away your entire fortune
doing the same thing a few years back?

00:11:42.305 --> 00:11:47.106
That time, two long shot teens
took first and second spot...

00:11:47.176 --> 00:11:49.144
...causing a major upset.

00:11:49.545 --> 00:11:54.209
But as I recall, they were both kids from
really high-class families, weren't they?

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:55.849
Must be nice.

00:11:55.918 --> 00:11:57.977
Have your parents pay for everything
while you focus on your studies...

00:11:58.054 --> 00:12:00.181
...and your future will be secure.

00:12:00.256 --> 00:12:03.123
But you know,
I've never heard of women...

00:12:03.192 --> 00:12:05.251
...being allowed to take
the National Exams.

00:12:05.328 --> 00:12:08.889
A highly respected teacher tried
and didn't get anywhere...

00:12:08.965 --> 00:12:12.401
...so there's no way some woman
can make it to the final exam!

00:12:12.702 --> 00:12:13.794
You got that right!

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:17.328
Besides, what's a woman doing
taking the exams in the first place?!

00:12:32.789 --> 00:12:34.780
Wh-What just happened here?

00:12:35.024 --> 00:12:37.254
I wonder.

00:12:37.326 --> 00:12:38.588
But it serves them right.

00:12:39.095 --> 00:12:41.427
We should eat before
the food gets cold.

00:12:42.065 --> 00:12:45.034
Eigetsu, you should drink your soup
and warm yourself up.

00:12:46.502 --> 00:12:47.628
R-Right!

00:12:53.176 --> 00:12:54.837
No one...

00:12:54.911 --> 00:13:00.645
...can gain what's really important
to them without making an effort.

00:13:02.318 --> 00:13:04.616
Take General Ran and Koyu.

00:13:05.254 --> 00:13:09.122
Being so young, they were
constantly ridiculed at first.

00:13:09.192 --> 00:13:11.683
But in the end,
they shut everyone up...

00:13:11.761 --> 00:13:13.922
...with a type of strength
we refer to as effort.

00:13:13.996 --> 00:13:17.864
Perhaps, all that's necessary is effort.

00:13:20.136 --> 00:13:22.070
Thank you, Father.

00:13:26.109 --> 00:13:31.069
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:13:38.855 --> 00:13:41.050
Here you go, Father.

00:13:41.124 --> 00:13:42.091
Thanks.

00:13:42.792 --> 00:13:44.919
Eigetsu, do you want
to try a sip of this?

00:13:46.162 --> 00:13:48.027
N-No! No thank you!

00:13:48.097 --> 00:13:50.190
My, aren't you at all curious?

00:13:50.266 --> 00:13:53.963
Ah, n-no! I'm really weak
when it comes to alcohol...

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:57.437
...and prefer not to even smell it.

00:13:58.374 --> 00:14:03.812
Hey, is it possible that the money
you're missing was taken by gangsters?

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:05.741
Maybe they forced you
to drink some wine...

00:14:05.815 --> 00:14:07.282
...and you passed out
or something?

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:11.616
No, I don't think that's likely.
Um, but...!

00:14:12.388 --> 00:14:14.856
It's not unthinkable that
there'd be one or two...

00:14:14.924 --> 00:14:18.087
...really skilled people in the capital
who could... but...!

00:14:18.628 --> 00:14:21.222
If that's the case, then it would
have to be the Seikin Gang.

00:14:21.531 --> 00:14:23.158
Seiran, do you know something?

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:28.360
Yes. It's a gang of hooligans
who arrived in town recently.

00:14:29.272 --> 00:14:32.901
They mark themselves by wearing
a blue cloth somewhere on their body.

00:14:33.776 --> 00:14:34.902
That's bad.

00:14:34.977 --> 00:14:38.174
Are you telling me that the crime bosses
are turning a blind eye to them?

00:14:38.381 --> 00:14:41.077
Up until now, that is.
But lately...

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:44.745
...the Seikin Gang have been
pretty flagrant in their activities.

00:14:45.054 --> 00:14:48.182
In that case, maybe the bosses
will make their move soon?

00:14:49.258 --> 00:14:52.716
No doubt the Seikin Gang's leader
isn't from the capital.

00:14:53.129 --> 00:14:56.257
Probably not. Since their actions
could be considered suicidal.

00:14:56.332 --> 00:14:57.594
Umm...

00:14:59.435 --> 00:15:02.768
Eigetsu, you don't know too much
about this city, do you?

00:15:03.072 --> 00:15:04.369
No.

00:15:04.807 --> 00:15:10.268
Here, in Kiyo, there's a clear distinction
between the state and downtown.

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:12.714
A clear distinction?

00:15:12.782 --> 00:15:13.806
Yes.

00:15:15.384 --> 00:15:20.913
In Kiyo, the underground crime bosses
manage the downtown hoodlums.

00:15:21.424 --> 00:15:23.358
At this time of year,
when there are more people...

00:15:23.426 --> 00:15:25.087
...visiting from other provinces
for the final...

00:15:25.161 --> 00:15:26.958
...they protect the peace
of the downtown core.

00:15:27.029 --> 00:15:31.762
The bosses take pride in ensuring
that everything is kept under control.

00:15:32.835 --> 00:15:35.531
But then what are the bosses doing?

00:15:36.239 --> 00:15:39.367
After all, Eigetsu did have
his money stolen.

00:15:39.775 --> 00:15:42.869
Ah, that hasn't been determined yet!

00:15:43.579 --> 00:15:47.276
The money was gathered
from the people of my hometown...

00:15:47.917 --> 00:15:50.784
...so I really feel bad about
losing it, but...!

00:15:50.853 --> 00:15:53.151
That makes matters
even worse!

00:15:53.222 --> 00:15:54.655
But it's all right.

00:15:54.724 --> 00:15:56.055
As long as I have this...!

00:16:03.432 --> 00:16:04.421
What's wrong?!

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:05.967
I-I-I-I-It's gone!

00:16:06.035 --> 00:16:07.627
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What's gone?!

00:16:07.703 --> 00:16:09.933
S-S-S-S-Sorry!
I've gotta go back!

00:16:10.006 --> 00:16:11.974
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Where?!

00:16:12.208 --> 00:16:14.039
Hey! Eigetsu!

00:16:17.413 --> 00:16:18.539
I'll go after them.

00:16:25.187 --> 00:16:26.484
Where'd he go?

00:16:32.995 --> 00:16:34.860
There he is. Eigetsu.

00:16:35.798 --> 00:16:38.631
Blue cloth.
That must be the Seikin Gang.

00:16:40.369 --> 00:16:42.132
Hey. You're the one,
aren't you?!

00:16:42.204 --> 00:16:47.403
The little brat who not only embarrassed
my guys last night, but robbed them too.

00:16:48.678 --> 00:16:52.478
I did that?!
I'm really sorry.

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:58.577
Eigetsu did? They have got to be
making some sort of mistake.

00:16:59.255 --> 00:17:01.052
You making fun of us?

00:17:01.123 --> 00:17:05.082
Um, would you know if perhaps
I dropped a token...

00:17:05.161 --> 00:17:06.753
...about this big, yesterday?

00:17:07.163 --> 00:17:11.600
A token?! Oh yeah, we've got it.
We've been collecting them.

00:17:12.034 --> 00:17:13.262
Collecting them?!

00:17:13.336 --> 00:17:15.099
Hey! Eigetsu!

00:17:15.504 --> 00:17:16.528
Who's she?

00:17:16.605 --> 00:17:19.768
Now's not the time for that!
Hurry up and run!

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:22.443
You're not going anywhere!

00:17:25.881 --> 00:17:28.679
G-Get them
and get that money back!

00:17:28.751 --> 00:17:30.116
- Right!
- Yeah!

00:17:33.622 --> 00:17:35.590
Shurei! Wait a minute!

00:17:35.925 --> 00:17:39.088
I won't wait! It's no use trying to
talk sense into that sort.

00:17:39.395 --> 00:17:42.091
- Discretion is the better part of valor!
- But...!

00:17:42.164 --> 00:17:44.860
Eigetsu. Was what they said
back there true?

00:17:45.868 --> 00:17:48.894
About you taking their money!
Do you remember anything about it?!

00:17:49.171 --> 00:17:51.696
- No, but maybe yes.
- Which is it?!

00:17:53.476 --> 00:17:54.807
Where'd they go?!

00:17:56.245 --> 00:17:57.303
No way!

00:17:57.646 --> 00:17:59.273
- There they are!
- Damn!

00:18:01.584 --> 00:18:05.111
I'm the one they're after, so please
escape on your own, Miss Shurei.

00:18:06.288 --> 00:18:07.255
Hey, wait!

00:18:08.858 --> 00:18:13.158
That's no good. You don't know your
way around this town. I can't do that.

00:18:13.629 --> 00:18:15.153
Miss Shurei.

00:18:17.166 --> 00:18:18.497
I found you!

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:26.171
Let's go, Eigetsu!

00:18:26.242 --> 00:18:27.539
W-Wow!

00:18:27.743 --> 00:18:31.543
S-Seiran told me that if you kick a man
in the groin, he'll drop like a rock.

00:18:32.014 --> 00:18:34.676
Yes, I did but... well done.

00:18:35.251 --> 00:18:37.776
Seiran! Did you see that, just now?

00:18:38.421 --> 00:18:40.889
Thanks to you, I couldn't make
much of an entrance.

00:18:41.123 --> 00:18:43.023
Hey! Did you find them?!

00:18:43.359 --> 00:18:46.851
They should still be in the area!
Search the neighborhood thoroughly!

00:18:47.062 --> 00:18:48.188
Right!

00:18:52.835 --> 00:18:55.929
At this rate, they're likely to
follow us to the residence.

00:18:56.605 --> 00:18:58.869
Eigetsu. Where are you trying to go?

00:18:59.141 --> 00:19:01.473
To a place called Kogaro
in the red-light district.

00:19:01.544 --> 00:19:03.341
Where I met Shurei earlier in the...!

00:19:05.181 --> 00:19:08.207
Lady Shurei!
I've been looking for you!

00:19:09.552 --> 00:19:13.750
Miss Kocho sent me. Please return to
Kogaro along with the young man and...

00:19:13.923 --> 00:19:18.519
...ah, if it's not a problem,
Seiran too.

00:19:19.161 --> 00:19:22.756
We'll have the underlings take care of
those annoying Seikin Gang members.

00:19:23.632 --> 00:19:24.758
Take care...?

00:19:25.267 --> 00:19:28.202
That's a great idea.
Given Kogaro's status...

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.602
...those hoodlums won't be able
to enter the premises.

00:19:30.806 --> 00:19:32.865
Seiran! You know Kogaro?

00:19:33.476 --> 00:19:35.103
We'll talk later!
Hurry!

00:19:35.177 --> 00:19:36.610
Ah, right!

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:46.044
Give me a break! How could you
leave that boy at some brothel?!

00:19:46.121 --> 00:19:48.589
Because it's the safest place.

00:19:49.258 --> 00:19:51.522
The red-light district itself
is a dangerous place!

00:19:51.594 --> 00:19:54.995
That's your prejudice talking.
It's actually quite safe.

00:19:55.598 --> 00:19:58.362
Not to mention the underground
is in control here.

00:19:58.434 --> 00:20:00.834
Well, considering that you never come
to the red-light district...

00:20:00.903 --> 00:20:03.371
...it's not surprising that you'd
have no clue about such things.

00:20:04.139 --> 00:20:07.836
You come too much!
What's with those women?!

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:11.812
Hello Mr. Ran!
You're here quite early today!

00:20:11.881 --> 00:20:14.076
And you've brought two
wonderful friends with you!

00:20:14.149 --> 00:20:15.446
Won't you please come
and see me?!

00:20:15.518 --> 00:20:18.214
You haven't been here in a while.
We've missed you.

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:21.355
Is this district your harem, Shuei?

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:25.888
Well, I guess you could say so. Although
its purpose is different from yours.

00:20:26.562 --> 00:20:29.053
You could think of this district...

00:20:29.532 --> 00:20:32.865
...as every man's harem.

00:20:34.637 --> 00:20:36.400
The brothel we're going to...

00:20:36.472 --> 00:20:39.208
...has women who are both
beautiful and accomplished...

00:20:39.208 --> 00:20:41.802
...that are equal to those
in your residence.

00:20:42.845 --> 00:20:44.813
You've got something
to look forward to.

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:46.882
Kogaro

00:20:46.882 --> 00:20:47.712
Kogaro
Kocho!

00:20:48.284 --> 00:20:50.912
Oh, Ran. Good timing.

00:20:51.787 --> 00:20:53.584
And who might these two be?

00:20:53.956 --> 00:20:55.480
My companions.

00:20:55.558 --> 00:20:57.788
They've come to see
the boy I left with you.

00:20:58.694 --> 00:21:00.753
Your companions?

00:21:03.032 --> 00:21:05.159
She certainly is beautiful.

00:21:05.234 --> 00:21:07.759
I've seldom seen
such a beauty.

00:21:07.836 --> 00:21:09.326
She's equal to Shusui.

00:21:10.039 --> 00:21:14.203
My. That last bit is unacceptable,
young master.

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:16.801
If you mean to compliment
a woman...

00:21:16.879 --> 00:21:19.211
...you mustn't compare her
to another woman.

00:21:20.149 --> 00:21:22.117
I-Is that so?

00:21:24.486 --> 00:21:26.010
What?!

00:21:26.188 --> 00:21:28.213
You let them get away?!

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:30.281
This is no time
to be fooling around!

00:21:30.359 --> 00:21:32.327
We're here to make a name
for ourselves...

00:21:32.394 --> 00:21:34.794
...here in the capital, as boss
of the downtown core!

00:21:34.863 --> 00:21:37.696
So what the hell are you doing,
unable to catch some boy?!

00:21:38.033 --> 00:21:40.331
In fact we have word of him...

00:21:40.836 --> 00:21:44.101
...going into a place called Kogaro
with a girl carrying an abacus.

00:21:46.976 --> 00:21:49.103
Kogaro? Hey, Keicho!

00:21:49.411 --> 00:21:50.469
Y-Yes!

00:21:51.113 --> 00:21:53.104
Is Kogaro a brothel?

00:21:53.182 --> 00:21:54.046
Yes.

00:21:54.116 --> 00:21:56.482
It's the top brothel of the capital's
red-light district.

00:21:56.552 --> 00:21:58.179
The renowned courtesan
Kocho there...

00:21:58.253 --> 00:22:00.881
...is said to have clients offering
up to one thousand gold coins.

00:22:00.956 --> 00:22:02.924
Oh? All right.

00:22:02.992 --> 00:22:06.587
To make up for all the trouble I've been
through, I think I'll make Kocho my girl!

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:12.060
We'll make Kogaro our new base!

00:22:13.302 --> 00:22:16.965
A girl carrying an abacus?
Could it be...?!

00:22:22.311 --> 00:22:26.805
Really. I certainly made
the right choice by going after them.

00:22:26.882 --> 00:22:30.147
Steal it, then threaten them,
and they'll pay any price to get it back.

00:22:30.686 --> 00:22:32.677
This is a great business.

00:22:33.389 --> 00:22:36.881
Okay, you guys!
Get everything packed up!

00:22:36.959 --> 00:22:39.450
Yeah!

00:22:56.145 --> 00:22:57.169
Shurei!

00:22:57.613 --> 00:22:59.740
What are you doing here?!

00:23:02.518 --> 00:23:07.785
So, you snuck out with General Ran and
Koyu to have fun at the brothel, did you?

00:23:09.058 --> 00:23:10.650
Y-You're mistaken, Shurei!

00:23:10.726 --> 00:23:13.092
I don't need to come
to a place like this for that!

00:23:13.162 --> 00:23:15.221
I can do it as much as I like
at my own place!

00:23:20.769 --> 00:23:24.796
Ah, well, you see,
I mean... Um...!

00:23:30.612 --> 00:23:35.709
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.918 --> 00:23:42.255
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.558 --> 00:23:47.518
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:52.827
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.836 --> 00:23:58.239
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.775 --> 00:24:04.906
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.681 --> 00:24:16.250
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.126 --> 00:24:22.723
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.132 --> 00:24:28.195
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:29.071 --> 00:24:34.634
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:35.010 --> 00:24:41.813
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.120 --> 00:24:45.554
Next Episode

00:24:45.554 --> 00:24:48.023
Next Episode
Before I knew it, I was back at Kogaro.

00:24:48.023 --> 00:24:48.056
Next Episode

00:24:48.056 --> 00:24:52.694
Next Episode
An Unexpected Surprise
But what is Ryuki doing here? And why
is Eigetsu being hunted by gangsters?

00:24:52.694 --> 00:24:53.061
Next Episode
An Unexpected Surprise

00:24:53.061 --> 00:24:54.096
Next Episode
An Unexpected Surprise
Hey, Santa! What?

00:24:54.096 --> 00:24:54.755
Hey, Santa! What?

00:24:54.830 --> 00:24:57.298
The Seikin Gang are going
to attack Kogaro?!
